WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:03.169
-Welcome, everybody. Welcome.
Have a seat, enjoy yourself.

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:06.205
Welcome to "The Tonight Show."
Thank you for watching.

00:00:06.205 --> 00:00:07.573
Thank you for being here.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.573 --> 00:00:10.876
You can feel that energy.
I love it.

00:00:10.876 --> 00:00:12.745 line:0%
Well, guys, today,
President Biden

00:00:12.745 --> 00:00:16.782 line:0%
held a meeting with the C.E.O.s
of Amazon, Apple, and Microsoft

00:00:16.782 --> 00:00:21.054 line:0%
to discuss the growing threat of
cyberattacks and data leaks.

00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:22.755
They've got their
work cut out for them,

00:00:22.755 --> 00:00:23.757
because right before
the meeting,

00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:24.957
you could hear a voice say,

00:00:24.957 --> 00:00:26.125
[ Russian accent ]
"Ready when you are."

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:28.161
[ Laughs ]

00:00:29.895 --> 00:00:32.632
Yeah, it was a good meeting,
although Biden's at that age

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:35.367
where he puts the word "the"
before anything tech-related,

00:00:35.367 --> 00:00:40.940
like, "I order from
the Amazon all the time.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:43.742
I just type it into the Google."

00:00:43.742 --> 00:00:46.078
At 78, Biden might not
seem like the right guy

00:00:46.078 --> 00:00:48.681
to handle this, but trust me,
no one is better equipped

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:50.717
at stopping leaks.

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:53.152
-Ah!

00:00:53.152 --> 00:00:56.389
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:58.191
-Thank you.

00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:00.092
-Depend.
-Here's some big news.

00:01:00.092 --> 00:01:02.462
Today, Johnson &amp; Johnson
announced that a booster shot

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:07.166
of their vaccine provides a
robust increase in antibodies.

00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:11.004
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:12.539
It's kind of like
Chef Boyardee saying,

00:01:12.539 --> 00:01:16.543
"Our new sauce
is robust in flavor."

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:19.145
Well, guys,
if doctors aren't busy enough,

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:21.380
they're now dealing with
the latest online trend.

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:22.549
Listen to this.

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:25.185 line:0%
-There is another
dangerous Internet challenge

00:01:25.185 --> 00:01:26.953 line:0%
that people should be
watching out for.

00:01:26.953 --> 00:01:29.922 line:0%
-It's something called the
Milk Crate Challenge.

00:01:29.922 --> 00:01:32.992 line:0%
Doctors warn it could land you
on a trip to the E.R.

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:35.561
-Half of Americans said,
"Of course,"

00:01:35.561 --> 00:01:36.862
while the other half said,

00:01:36.862 --> 00:01:39.465
"It's my choice, and I want to
do my own research."

00:01:39.465 --> 00:01:41.667
No. Don't do that.

00:01:41.667 --> 00:01:43.970
Seriously, imagine surviving
a global pandemic,

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:46.539
then having your family find out
it's the Milk Crate Challenge

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:47.907
is what got you.

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:49.209
Some business news.

00:01:49.209 --> 00:01:52.879
Today, OnlyFans
decided to drop their plan

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:55.114
to ban
sexually explicit content.

00:01:55.114 --> 00:01:58.617
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:58.617 --> 00:02:01.954
♪♪
-Wow!

00:02:01.954 --> 00:02:04.323
Whole corner of them.
-Yeah.

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:07.727
So, between this and
the new "Spider-Man" trailer,

00:02:07.727 --> 00:02:08.961
what a week for teenage boys.

00:02:08.961 --> 00:02:14.533
You know what I'm saying?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:14.533 --> 00:02:16.035
That's right -- OnlyFans will

00:02:16.035 --> 00:02:18.838
keep allowing
sexually explicit content.

00:02:18.838 --> 00:02:20.172
Thank goodness,
because without this,

00:02:20.172 --> 00:02:22.207
