decked out with Nerf toys.

00:02:29.848 --> 00:02:30.850
Check this out.

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:32.085
-Ooh!

00:02:32.085 --> 00:02:33.352
-Yeah.

00:02:33.352 --> 00:02:34.787
Yeah, it's great if
you're training your kid

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:36.389
to be the next John Wick.

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:41.060
It's like 30 guns.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:42.995 line:0%
And, finally,
