the Apple Crisp Macchiato.

00:02:48.768 --> 00:02:51.037 line:0%
In response, the
Pumpkin Spice Latte was like,

00:02:51.037 --> 00:02:52.171 line:0%
"Oh, it's on.

00:02:52.171 --> 00:02:54.306 line:0%
